100 INIT101 REM 20 CENTERED RECTANGLES GROW OUTWARD IN A LOOP105 PAGE107 REM SCALE BY 130/1024 AND CENTER THE 97.5-UNIT HEIGHT110 S=130/1024115 REM COMPUTE OPPOSITE CORNERS FOR EACH RECTANGLE120 FOR I=1 TO 20130 A=(512-16*I)*S140 B=(512+16*I)*S150 C=(384-9*I)*S+1.25160 D=(384+9*I)*S+1.25170 MOVE A,C180 DRAW B,C190 DRAW B,D200 DRAW A,D210 DRAW A,C220 NEXT I230 END